# WZDM LiveRecord - Environment Variables Template

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your Supabase credentials.

```env
# Supabase URL (from Supabase dashboard: Settings → API)
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Supabase anon key (from Supabase dashboard: Settings → API)
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Supabase service role key (from Supabase dashboard: Settings → API)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Frontend URL (default for local dev)
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Server host and port
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=4000
```

**Important**: Never commit `.env` to version control. It contains sensitive keys.
